    "source_excerpt": "The product label for hydroxyzine recommends women who are pregnant not use this medication. This is because there is not enough information available on the use of hydroxyzine to know what effect, if any, it could have on a human pregnancy. However, the benefit of using hydroxyzine might outweigh possible risks. Your healthcare provider can talk with you about using hydroxyzine and what treatment is best for you."
